# Normalize line endings to LF for every text file this repo actually tracks, regardless of a given
# contributor's own core.autocrlf setting, OS, or editor — this repo's own files (Makefile,
# CMakeLists.txt, cmake/*.cmake, workflow YAML) are consumed by tools (GNU Make, WSL builds, Linux
# CI) that don't need CRLF and shouldn't depend on one machine's global git config getting it right.
# Does not touch ForgeSrc/ForgeWiki (git submodules, tracked as gitlinks here — their own working
# trees are governed by their own repos, never this file).
* text=auto eol=lf
